@MovieVault_HostAddress = http://localhost:5070

### Create an account
POST {{MovieVault_HostAddress}}/api/Account/AccountCreation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "username": "testuser",
  "fullname": "Test User",
  "password": "SuperSecret123",
  "dateOfBirth": "2000-01-01"
}

### Log in (Token / RefreshToken come back as response headers)
POST {{MovieVault_HostAddress}}/api/Account/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "SuperSecret123"
}

### Exchange a refresh token for a new access token
POST {{MovieVault_HostAddress}}/api/Account/RefreshToken
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "paste-the-RefreshToken-header-value-here"
}

### List movies (needs Authorization: Bearer <Token header from Login>)
GET {{MovieVault_HostAddress}}/api/Movies/GetAllMovies
Authorization: Bearer paste-the-Token-header-value-here

###
